```

- **时机**：首页功能组件需要时**按需**拉取
- **不做**周期性轮询（至少在这几处未见 timer）

#### C. 扫码授权确认后 — `WKAuthorizedViewModel.refreshDeviceList()`

```42:57:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/native_app/source_code/WearfitPro-feat-sdk-glass_sdk_merge_20260521_16kb/app/src/main/java/com/wakeup/WKAuthorizedViewModel.kt
    fun refreshDeviceList(snCode: String) {
        launchIO {
            val result =
                RetrofitManager.getInstance().apiDevice.getUserDeviceList(SystemUtils.getLanguage().language)
            if (result.isSuccess()) {
                DeviceDao.syncBindDevices(result.data)
                if (result.data.isNotEmpty()) {
                    val first = result.data[0]
                    DeviceDao.saveLastDeviceMac(first.mac)
                    CacheManager.saveString(Constants.SPKey.DEVICE_SN + first.mac, snCode)
                    EventMgr.deviceBindEvent.post(first)
                    EventMgr.deviceListChange.post(true)
                }
            }
            loginState.postValue(true)
        }
    }
```

- **时机**：`confirmLogin()` 成功后立即刷新列表

#### D. 登录成功路径对比

`saveModel()` 流程（`LoginRepository.kt:523-537`）：

```523:537:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/native_app/source_code/WearfitPro-feat-sdk-glass_sdk_merge_20260521_16kb/app/src/zh/java/com/wakeup/howear/login/LoginRepository.kt
    private suspend fun saveModel(userModel: UserModel) {
        UserDao.saveUser(userModel)
        try {
            val result = dataSource.getUserInfo()
            if (result.isSuccess()) {
                UserDao.saveUserByInfo(result.data)
                loginListener.onLoginSuccess(currentLoginEnum)
