### 1.4 与服务端合并逻辑 — `DeviceDao.syncBindDevices`

文件：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/native_app/source_code/WearfitPro-feat-sdk-glass_sdk_merge_20260521_16kb/common/src/main/java/com/wakeup/common/storage/DeviceDao.java`

```95:129:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/native_app/source_code/WearfitPro-feat-sdk-glass_sdk_merge_20260521_16kb/common/src/main/java/com/wakeup/common/storage/DeviceDao.java
    public static synchronized void syncBindDevices(List<DeviceModel> serviceList) {
        List<DeviceModel> list = getDeviceList();
        List<DeviceModel> reslutList = new ArrayList<>();
        // 遍历本地列表
        for (DeviceModel model : list) {
            DeviceModel serviceModel = CollectionUtils.find(serviceList, item -> Objects.equals(item.getMac(), model.getMac()));
            if (serviceModel != null) {
                serviceModel.setTemp(false);
                reslutList.add(serviceModel);  // 用服务端数据替换本地
            } else {
                if (model.isTemp()) {
                    reslutList.add(model);  // 临时设备保留
                }
                // 非 temp 且服务端没有 → 丢弃
            }
        }
        // 服务端有、本地没有 → 追加
        for (DeviceModel serviceModel : serviceList) {
            DeviceModel model = CollectionUtils.find(list, item -> Objects.equals(serviceModel.getMac(), item.getMac()));
            if (model == null) {
                reslutList.add(serviceModel);
            }
        }
        saveList(reslutList);
        for (DeviceModel device : reslutList) {
            addConnectedDevice(device);
        }
    }
```

合并规则（按 MAC）：

1. **MAC 匹配**：服务端记录**整行覆盖**本地，`isTemp = false`
2. **仅本地 temp**：保留
3. **仅本地非 temp、服务端无**：**删除**（解绑后列表同步）
4. **仅服务端有**：追加到本地
5. 同步后更新 `CACHE_CONNECTED_DEVICE_LIST` 历史

相关存储键：

- `CACHE_DEVICE_LIST` — 绑定设备列表
- `CACHE_LAST_DEVICE_MAC` / `CACHE_CURRENT_DEVICE_MAC` — 当前/最后设备 MAC
- `CACHE_CONNECTED_DEVICE_LIST` — 连接历史

`DeviceInfoDao`（`otaVersionCode` 等 BLE 握手信息）与 list API **独立**，不同步覆盖。

